---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Recall Software Showdown: Manual SMS vs Automated Workflows — RetainOS'
const description = 'We benchmarked manual SMS recall against automated workflow recall across 12 pilot clinics. Here\'s what the data says.'
const pageUrl = 'https://retaindental.com/blog/recall-showdown'
const publishedDate = '2026-05-28'
const modifiedDate = '2026-06-16'
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  pageType="article"
  articlePublishedTime={publishedDate}
  canonical={pageUrl}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: 'https://retaindental.com/' },
    { name: 'Blog', url: 'https://retaindental.com/blog' },
    { name: 'Recall Showdown', url: pageUrl },
  ]}
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 bg-cream-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/blog" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transform: rotate(180deg)"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        Back to blog
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-violet-600 bg-violet-600/10 border border-violet-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-widest">Operations</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-text-600 font-bold">5 min read</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-text-600 font-bold">{publishedDate}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-text-900 tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] mb-8">
        Recall Software Showdown: Manual SMS vs Automated Workflows
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-600 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-xl text-text-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Recall is the single highest-ROI workflow in any dental practice. The question is: does
          the difference between "manual SMS" and "automated workflow" actually matter? We benchmarked.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">The setup</h2>
        <p>
          Across 12 pilot clinics, we ran a 90-day comparison:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-text-600">
          <li><strong>Control group (6 clinics)</strong> — Manual SMS reminders, front desk chased no-shows by phone the next day</li>
          <li><strong>Test group (6 clinics)</strong> — RetainOS automated workflow: T-14 days, T-7 days, T-1 day, T+1 hour after no-show, T+7 days reactivation</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">The results</h2>

        <div class="not-prose grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
          <div class="bg-cream-100 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-black text-text-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Manual SMS</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-black text-text-900 mb-1">62%</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-600">Recall appointment kept</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-violet-600/10 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-violet-600/20">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-black text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Automated workflow</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-black text-violet-600 mb-1">87%</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-600">Recall appointment kept</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">Why the gap</h2>
        <p>
          Three things drive the difference:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-text-600">
          <li><strong>Timing density</strong> — 4 touchpoints over 21 days beats 1 single SMS</li>
          <li><strong>Channel variety</strong> — patients who ignore SMS open push notifications (and vice versa)</li>
          <li><strong>Self-service booking</strong> — "tap to reschedule" beats "call the front desk"</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-text-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">The revenue math</h2>
        <p>
          For a practice with 1,800 active patients, a 25 percentage-point improvement in recall
          completion is roughly <strong>$38,000 in additional annual revenue</strong> — recovered
          hygiene visits that would otherwise have lapsed.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most recall automation platforms pay for themselves in the first 60 days.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-ink-900 rounded-2xl text-white">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-2">Try RetainOS free for 14 days</h3>
          <p class="text-text-onDark-500 text-sm mb-4">Live on your real patients in 20 minutes.</p>
          <a href="https://app.retaindental.com" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-white text-ink-900 rounded-full font-black transition-transform">
            Start free trial →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
